		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3792&amp;p=29587#p29587"><![CDATA[
I have a new feature request:<br><br>Thank you for all the hard work in developing OpenGD77.  It works great for my Baofeng 1801 and 1701.  I especially like the TG lists and the ability to assign a talk group list to a channel and not having to have a separate Channel for each TG like on the Anytone 878.<br><br>Here is my feature request for your consideration:<br>Add the option to use the channel know (on 1701) to scroll through vertical menus instead of the up/down arrow keys.<br>I think that this option would be easier to use for the User Interface than the up/down arrow keys.<br>For instance, you could assign a Quick Key to bring up the Zones menu (already works) then use the Channel KNow to quickly select a Zone.<br>Would this feature be hard to program?<br><br>Whant do you think?<br>Thank You,<br>Dave W4EIP<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2677">W4EIP</a> — Sat Feb 17, 2024 2:58 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
